Variant form of {{och-l|閒|space, gap}} with {{och-l|*月|moon}} replaced by {{och-l|*日|day}}.

===Etymology===
The two pronunciations are related, with Pronunciation 2 ({{och-l|間|id=2}}) being the [[exoactive]] of Pronunciation 1 ({{och-l|間|id=1}}).

Related to:
* {{och-l|隙|crack; chink}}, {{och-l|澗|ravine; brook (between mountains)}} ({{zh-ref|Wang, 1982}});
* {{och-l|閒|lazy; leisure}} ({{zh-ref|Karlgren, 1957}}; {{zh-ref|Baxter, 1992}}).

Externally, likely related to {{cog|lus|kâr||space between; interval}}, {{cog|my|ကြား||in-between; interval; interim}}, {{m|my|အကြား||gap; break}} ({{zh-ref|Schuessler, 2007}}).

